        {"zh": "干草原上多了一头幼兽。", "en": "One more young beast on the dry plains."},
        {"zh": "第一次站起来，腿还抖。", "en": "I stand for the first time, legs shaking."},
        {"zh": "这地方有草，也有掠夺者。", "en": "This place has grass, and pillagers."},
        {"zh": "我坐下了，先歇一会儿。", "en": "I sit down to rest a while."},
        {"zh": "蛋壳碎了，我出来了。", "en": "The shell cracked and I came out."}
      ]
